### Chat Module API Tests
### Use these with VS Code REST Client extension

@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000
@userId = MbG3wwDSH1o5lqQYoFG1

# =============================================================================
# Provider Information
# =============================================================================

### List available providers
GET {{baseUrl}}/chat/providers

###

# =============================================================================
# Chat - Single Turn
# =============================================================================

### Basic chat with Groq (default)
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat/message?user_id={{userId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "What foods are high in iron during pregnancy?"
}

###

### Chat with Gemini
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat/message?user_id={{userId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "What are good sources of omega-3 for pregnant women?",
  "provider": "gemini"
}

###

### Chat without sources
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat/message?user_id={{userId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "How much water should I drink daily?",
  "provider": "groq",
  "include_sources": false
}

###

### Chat with specific model
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat/message?user_id={{userId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "What are symptoms of iron deficiency?",
  "provider": "groq",
  "model": "llama-3.1-8b-instant"
}

###

### Health question
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat/message?user_id={{userId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "I've been feeling very tired lately. Is this normal during pregnancy?",
  "provider": "groq"
}

###

### Nutrition question
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat/message?user_id={{userId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "What should I eat for breakfast to get more protein?",
  "provider": "groq"
}

###

# =============================================================================
# Chat - Streaming
# =============================================================================

### Stream response with Groq
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat/stream?user_id={{userId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Explain the importance of folic acid during pregnancy",
  "provider": "groq"
}

###

### Stream response with Gemini
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat/stream?user_id={{userId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "What are the best foods for baby brain development?",
  "provider": "gemini"
}

###

# =============================================================================
# Message History
# =============================================================================

### Get message history
GET {{baseUrl}}/chat/history/{{userId}}?limit=20

###

### Get limited history
GET {{baseUrl}}/chat/history/{{userId}}?limit=5

###

### Clear message history
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/chat/history/{{userId}}

###

# =============================================================================
# Context Verification (using memory endpoints)
# =============================================================================

### Verify Layer 4 (Message History) via Context Pyramid
GET {{baseUrl}}/memory/context/{{userId}}/layer/4

###

### Get full context pyramid
POST {{baseUrl}}/memory/context/{{userId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "nutrition advice",
  "max_tokens": 2000
}

###
